@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### ==========================================
### MÓDULO: PROVEEDORES — casos exitosos
### ==========================================

### HU-01 — Crear proveedor (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "PROV-001",
  "razon_social": "Distribuidora Norte SA",
  "cuit": "30-71234567-8",
  "email": "ventas@norte.com",
  "telefono": "381-555-0100",
  "activo": true
}

### HU-01 — Crear segundo proveedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "PROV-002",
  "razon_social": "Alimentos del Valle SRL",
  "cuit": "30-70998877-1",
  "email": "",
  "telefono": "",
  "activo": true
}

### HU-02 — Listar proveedores (paginación default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/

### HU-02 — Listar solo activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/?activo=true&skip=0&limit=10

### HU-03 — Detalle por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/1

### HU-04 — Actualizar proveedor (PUT total)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "PROV-001",
  "razon_social": "Distribuidora Norte Ampliada SA",
  "cuit": "30-71234567-8",
  "email": "contacto@norte.com",
  "telefono": "381-555-0199",
  "activo": true
}

### HU-05 — Desactivar proveedor
PUT {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/2/desactivar

### HU-02 — Listar inactivos
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/?activo=false

### ==========================================
### ESCENARIOS DE ERROR
### ==========================================

### RN-01 / RN-03 — 422 código vacío y razón social corta
POST {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "",
  "razon_social": "AB",
  "cuit": "30-70000000-0"
}

### RN-02 — 409 código duplicado
POST {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "PROV-001",
  "razon_social": "Otro Proveedor SA",
  "cuit": "30-71111111-1"
}

### RN-04 — 404 ID inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/999

### RN-04 — 404 actualizar inexistente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "PROV-999",
  "razon_social": "Fantasma SA",
  "cuit": "30-79999999-9"
}

### RN-05 — 409 desactivar ya desactivado (ejecutar dos veces seguidas)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/proveedores/2/desactivar
